    "title": "The Gmeiner to host festive Dickens-themed vendor event - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Melina Moyer, Director, Gmeiner Art Cultural Center ,\n10 hours ago Wellsboro, Pa. — The Gmeiner Art & Cultural Center is excited to host a festive vendor gathering that coincides with Wellsboro’s annual Dickens of a Christmas celebration. On Saturday, Dec. 6, from 10 a.m. to 4 p.m., visitors can browse a diverse range of handmade items crafted by local artisans inside the Gmeiner’s Studio at 134 Main Street, just behind the Green Free Library. This free event offers a chance to shop for unique, locally made pottery, jewelry, fused glass art, and much more — ideal for holiday gifts and spreading seasonal joy. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
